:: Lake House Bathroom

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "lakehouse">><<effects>>
You are in the bathroom.
<br><br>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<set $previousPassage to $passage>>
	<<passoutlakehouse>>
<<else>>
	<<if $lakehouse.billsphase gte 3>>
		You can't use the bath without water.
		<br>
	<<elseif $leftarm is "bound" and $rightarm is "bound">>
		<<set _clothed = ![V.worn.upper.name, V.worn.lower.name, V.worn.under_upper.name, V.worn.under_lower.name, V.worn.over_upper.name, V.worn.over_lower.name].every(x => x == 'naked')>>
		<<bathroomicon>><<link [["Have a bath " + (_clothed ? " in clothes " : "") + "(0:30)"->Lake House Bath]]>><<water>><<pass 30>><<stress -6>><<set $hygiene to 0>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<<else>>
		<<bathroomicon>><<link [[Have a bath (0:30)->Lake House Bath]]>><<strip>><<pass 30>><<stress -6>><<set $hygiene to 0>><</link>><<lstress>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<!-- Check if there's any hair-->
	<<if $lakehouse.billsphase gte 3>>
		You can't shave without lights.
		<br>
	<<elseif $pbdisable is "f" and ($pblevel gte 2 or $pbstrip gte 1 or $pblevelballs gte 2)>>
		<<shaveicon>><<link [[Groom pubic hair->Lake House Shave]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<pregnancyTest "Lake House Bedroom">>
	<br>

	<<main_hall_icon>><<link [[Living Room (0:01)->Lake House]]>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Lake House Bath
<<effects>><<set $location to "lakehouse">><<set $outside to 0>>
<<set $danger to random(1, 10000)>><<set $dangerevent to 0>>
<<if $danger gte (9900 - $allure / 3) and $hallucinations gte 2 and $slimedisable is "f" and $controlled is 0>>
	You wash until you're squeaky clean.<<wash>>
	<br><br>

	As you remove the plug to drain the water, you feel something probe your <<genitals>>. You look between your legs, but you don't see anything abnormal. When you try to stand up however, translucent tendrils rise from the water and force you back down.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bath Slime]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
You wash until you're squeaky clean.<<wash>>
