	<<elseif ((currentSkillValue('physique') / 160) + (currentSkillValue('willpower') / 10)) gte (($pain - 100) + random(1, 100))>>
		The pain is too much for you and you quickly lift yourself off of the wooden horse.
		<<ggwillpower>><<willpower 10>>
		<br><br>

		Despite the pain, you feel a strong catharsis.<<trauma -12>>
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Lake House Basement]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		The pain is too much for you <span class="red">but your arms fail before you could get off the wooden horse.</span>
		<<ggwillpower>><<willpower 10>><<masopain 25>>
		
		<<if $pain gte 200>>
			<br><br>
			<span class="red">The pain is overwhelming.</span>
			<<gggstress>><<stress 50>>
		<</if>>

		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|$passage]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
